# Merseine (Bot2's) on Bot1's Vault Skirge, {1}{B/P}, with Bot1's Zirda, the Dawnwaker: "abilities you activate ... cost {2}
# less ... can't reduce the mana in that cost to less than one mana". How the {B/P} is paid is announced as the ability is
# proposed (CR 118.13a, 601.2b), before the total is determined (CR 601.2f): paid with 2 life, the mana in the cost is {1},
# which Zirda can't take below one. So on turn 2, with every source of Bot1's tapped, the ability is not offered (not a free
# {0} and 2 life); on turn 3 Mox Ruby's {R} and 2 life pay it, and nothing is left in the pool.
